{"time": 1766066880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1316607071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "落地打理一下头发，看看安娜，\"感觉如何?\""}
