{"time": 1766323644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989274184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻轻拍拍她的背，另外注意一下是不是她压着自己的胸口了"}
{"time": 1766323684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017351158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（安娜的身材是不是还略大来着）"}
{"time": 1766323695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706972248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(是的)"}
{"time": 1766323696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399607600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "虽然是这样，但好像不是因为这样"}
{"time": 1766323770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417719633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些奇怪，一边安抚安娜，一边慢慢调理一下自己的身体，\"嘶...\""}
{"time": 1766323793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935429136", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（姑且因为虽然应该不太可能）"}
{"time": 1766323799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322835959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（姑且一问虽然应该不太可能）"}
{"time": 1766323812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438793051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（睡觉有拉窗帘吗，还是要在城市的霓虹灯下睡着）"}
{"time": 1766323877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1731866900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(应该拉了)"}
{"time": 1766323911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818495374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（那就没问题）"}
{"time": 1766323992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811756455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "在你的安抚下安娜醒了过来，不知道怎么的额头满是汗，刚醒过来就用力抱住了你“.......仙仙姐.....”"}
{"time": 1766324037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323209205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了？做噩梦了吗？\"自己也有些不舒服，但还是优先关注安娜的问题"}
{"time": 1766324172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591086581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“诶？嗯......”似乎一下子又给她少了很多印象，但是还是有些闷闷不乐，因此放开了抱住你的手"}
{"time": 1766324243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60320394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我去喝杯水”她一边坐起来对你露出了个微笑"}
{"time": 1766324322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396172744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(少了很多印象是什么意思)"}
{"time": 1766324346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137238295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "(少了很多印象是什么意思)"}
{"time": 1766324358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879068859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（指对梦的）"}
{"time": 1766324383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506013888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"自己也坐起身，拉开窗帘看看外面"}
{"time": 1766324717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434957797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "安娜去客厅喝水的时候，仙仙拉开窗帘看到了天外的圆夜，天空恰恰是月亮所在的边缘不知何时要露出了如同荧屏破裂般的圆形破口，真正的月亮正显露其外，你看得到，那鲜红的像是藤蔓般的巨大存在爬满了那可怜的皎洁球体，如红色般的光点正在其球体之上显露"}
{"time": 1766324732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733603812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你的不安感正是由此而来"}
{"time": 1766324875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457706000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "立刻拉上窗帘，\"...\"摇摇头，这种事情等他们醒了之后再讨论吧，深呼吸，\"安娜，可以给我也倒一杯吗\""}
{"time": 1766324990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811202169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯？嗯！”只听两声语气词，不一会就看到安娜拿着两杯温水从客厅回来了"}
{"time": 1766325032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937037137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“仙仙姐脸色也不好，怎么了？”她一边说着，坐到旁边，递出水杯"}
{"time": 1766325143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068342717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉胸口有点闷。\"深呼吸，\"不太舒服，喝点水应该就好了。\""}
{"time": 1766325213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394871177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这样吗？”安娜伸出手来柔了柔你平坦的胸口"}
{"time": 1766325263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093601786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（应该用抚更合适罢）"}
{"time": 1766325286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932937839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "其实有点意外，\"嗯...\"盯着她看了好一会，接过水小口啜饮，\"喝完就睡吧，明天应该还会很忙。\""}
{"time": 1766325385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490602341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（那么没行动就跳了）"}
{"time": 1766325455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098940718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(跳吧)"}
{"time": 1766325457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762535280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么第二天，各位该怎么自然醒就怎么醒"}
{"time": 1766325502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296725043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "带着不舒服的沉重感醒来，皱着眉头"}
{"time": 1766325563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439685997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#昏沉的头晕与不真实感席卷脑海"}
{"time": 1766325627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385854934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#随即景象在眼前重合，从帕特森的腿上醒来"}
{"time": 1766325645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473366514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“第二天了吗。”"}
{"time": 1766325650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038114068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#看看手环"}
