{"time": 1766329749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658136088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“嗯？”#帕特森付款买下后又给他塞了点小费“可以和我讲讲吗，我好奇发生了什么”"}
{"time": 1766329756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920876631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#小声询问"}
{"time": 1766329785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757809716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "他摆了摆手，面露难色没收那个小费“最近关键词收的紧”"}
{"time": 1766329792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326068034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“理解”"}
{"time": 1766329814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910197526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“毕竟装了芯片，会被录下声音”"}
{"time": 1766329843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435018381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“理解理解，不过小哥，为什么嵌入式比这种眼镜的要便宜呢”"}
{"time": 1766329847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236511378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“正常倒是没人关注个小人物，不谈这些关键词”"}
{"time": 1766329849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277232331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“老板，像我们这种喜欢古老小玩意的人还多吗”"}
{"time": 1766329855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560081615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“按理来说，新产品不是应该更贵吗”"}
{"time": 1766329899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597831092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=435018381]“产线多咯，比起这个，你应该问为什么AR更贵”"}
{"time": 1766329912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111682535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“AR更贵，你们不就买嵌入了”"}
{"time": 1766329913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167468308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那么为什么更贵呢”"}
{"time": 1766329919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946891334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“。。。”"}
{"time": 1766329927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236306604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "他一边说着递给AR，一边把那个钱给收了"}
{"time": 1766329929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081023151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“还真是”"}
{"time": 1766329943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258303161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“。。。”#总觉得嵌入式有什么大问题"}
{"time": 1766329961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530234804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那么小哥，这附近有什么图书馆吗”"}
{"time": 1766329981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201231323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“晚上有空一起喝个酒怎么样”"}
{"time": 1766330026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148864240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“图书馆？现在哪还有这种博物馆，不过”他露出了若有所思的神情“你们喜欢纸质书？”似乎有所感怀"}
{"time": 1766330059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314739845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“是的，纸张特有的油墨味和触感让我觉得自己在读好书”"}
{"time": 1766330106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265820934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“更重要的是，比起复制黏贴的文本，书籍其实更难篡改历史吧。”"}
{"time": 1766330109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488575711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#意味深"}
{"time": 1766330113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470639003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那么有书店，旧书店之类的吗”"}
{"time": 1766330123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270595180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“唉，我女儿也是”他叹了一口气“虽然我一直不懂这个，对了，我女儿认识个朋友开有私家书店，我可以推荐你们去”"}
{"time": 1766330139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943688925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“哦？”"}
{"time": 1766330146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402112840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那就谢过店长了”"}
{"time": 1766330156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697960294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那就多谢小哥你了，方便加个联系方式吗”"}
{"time": 1766330159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721565840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“唉，你们给我做了交易嘛”"}
{"time": 1766330161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793932551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#对着他微微致意"}
{"time": 1766330170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148018483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#用买的ar加个联系方式吧"}
{"time": 1766330182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604455421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“有东西要买还会找你的”"}
{"time": 1766330183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357766167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么他给了你们个dd（qq）的联系方式"}
{"time": 1766330232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800466520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#加好了后对他笑笑，同时看看网络上有没有关于昨晚月亮的讨论"}
{"time": 1766330283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887735148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（网络上的线索容易被删掉，尤其是我们没有计算机，只能从实体书入手查了）"}
{"time": 1766330391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379712809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（嗯）"}
{"time": 1766330437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697983494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么你刚刚那么一想互联网就给你推了不少相关信息，如果基本都是些无伤大雅的，唯一和那个破掉天幕的洞有关系的是说有从近来以来反对未来公司医药部门癌症药物研究的组织昨夜摧毁了某个研究基地，并且用那里的装置摧毁了天幕，据说已经伤亡百余人"}
{"time": 1766330522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1183971278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#查查看这个组织是什么"}
{"time": 1766330738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431662094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "未来公司的官方命名是【血根骑士团】，下面还有行简介，介绍了那是群不喜欢用机械植入，也不能算是喜欢用生物改造这种比较偏离正道的歪门邪道的人"}
{"time": 1766330772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011505867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "而是被血根这种植物寄生的歪门邪道，关于血根这个简介只说了会加强个人体质，还有让人变得有暴力欲望，通过寄生生物的方法繁衍"}
{"time": 1766330873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825540057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（生化危机说是）"}
