{"time": 1766372276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897377428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“仙仙，这是你的同伴吗”#看着那个法杖小声和仙仙打趣"}
