{"time": 1766374556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291492860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "虽然有指控，证明他们很可能让那些先天缺陷者参与了人体实验"}
{"time": 1766374588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164162985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“这个未来公司肯定知道月亮上的东西，环境可能都是月亮出事后引发的并发症”"}
