{"time": 1766389138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026196139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(再说吧，你最好用了这一次就别再用了)"}
{"time": 1766389152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144454868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(引起警觉就不好了)"}
{"time": 1766389159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996880241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(只用一次应该问题不大)"}
{"time": 1766389183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702179051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "这之后钱也算花的差不多了，回到书店，把手机分一台给可能还在挂机的仙仙。随后和亚麻交换一下联系方式，顺带也把帕特森的号码要过来"}
{"time": 1766389203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197025630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（之后还要去事故现场呢，笑）"}
{"time": 1766389220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553261001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1889112988]“祂善”"}
{"time": 1766389221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835228121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=5D6D1BDBFC7512F225EF8752ECD44F96.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTAju8lSMlplRS1GckRSzn3gDoHZhikzAUg_wooqr6q0NjQkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQhkzwb9z_0mUm-gRyftrDonoCmq-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMFEHxTv3TeuFqIUD8Z-bnXnNQVIiB6KLkQLuKJZ6r0PcrWNmGHFaUgeJXVd_CPiIng,file_size=91684]"}
{"time": 1766389252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870432539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“这是天父的教义吗?”"}
{"time": 1766389274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143595937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“当然，我们一生要以善为人，否则便会堕入地狱”"}
