{"time": 1766389859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336366341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=536066336]总之，先打车过去了"}
{"time": 1766389885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1956373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（不过我能说这么旁侧敲击的问前台是问不出结果的）"}
{"time": 1766389964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549680274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(也是)"}
{"time": 1766389971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1426946862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(前台能懂什么)"}
{"time": 1766389983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593500160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=597895383]总而言之，前台又和你科普了一遍耶稣的神术之类的，虽然部分像是硫磺与天火之类的好像不太友好被非常简单的跳过了"}
{"time": 1766390025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696976091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（前台就算懂，那也只能跟你们说常识，我现在直接跟你们说明面上的都是基督教的事情，你们就不用考虑那么多了）"}
{"time": 1766390041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009674404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(嗯，理解)"}
