{"time": 1766391272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122454386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（奶不进去就说明没有生命力啊（））"}
{"time": 1766391315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760415389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（话也不能完全那么说）"}
{"time": 1766391377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "563508782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那你随便扔了个治疗法术，种子上但是种子没有发出正常的金色光芒而是某种黑色的光，看起来有点萎了"}
{"time": 1766391382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354842624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“嗯，回去吧”"}
{"time": 1766391387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759672695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#牵着她走吧"}
{"time": 1766391458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427799598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“在哪找到的？这个……感觉像负能量产物，搞不好也有寄生性质，夜鸦要小心”赶紧收手"}
{"time": 1766391530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409679982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“它是今早刷牙的时候我呕出来的”夜鸦不再凝视这个种子，而是抬起头看向了你"}
{"time": 1766391535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274652186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“但是很甜”"}
{"time": 1766391581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961559836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:json,data={\"ver\":\"1.0.0.19\"&#44;\"prompt\":\"&#91;QQ小程序&#93;铃兰：妈妈你看我鸟你不\"&#44;\"config\":{\"type\":\"normal\"&#44;\"width\":0&#44;\"height\":0&#44;\"forward\":1&#44;\"autoSize\":0&#44;\"ctime\":1766391574&#44;\"token\":\"a75c25f2fde2858116e39e46df7f16b1\"}&#44;\"needShareCallBack\":false&#44;\"app\":\"com.tencent.miniapp_01\"&#44;\"view\":\"view_8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"meta\":{\"detail_1\":{\"appid\":\"1109937557\"&#44;\"appType\":0&#44;\"title\":\"哔哩哔哩\"&#44;\"desc\":\"铃兰：妈妈你看我鸟你不\"&#44;\"icon\":\"http:\\/\\/miniapp.gtimg.cn\\/public\\/appicon\\/432b76be3a548fc128acaa6c1ec90131_200.jpg\"&#44;\"preview\":\"https:\\/\\/qq.ugcimg.cn\\/v1\\/qa0m914o2lsi0n44b3j7qiv2ofupcl6e8435tait8k4ouvndvsi3a0sd2c9evkn23h59hksihnhvl9evdtkrg6orf6ufmd7asicj0undod3dtdbkuk3jfr3tmsueu8990gf4qkjs9nqaiv11e65dla125c\\/e9vf2tsqr6j29hl2kodb3vahlc\"&#44;\"url\":\"m.q.qq.com\\/a\\/s\\/755ae6eb9af4cbbbceb0e0f805d35dc2\"&#44;\"scene\":1036&#44;\"host\":{\"uin\":2275904091&#44;\"nick\":\"冰黎曦\"}&#44;\"shareTemplateId\":\"8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"shareTemplateData\":{}&#44;\"qqdocurl\":\"https:\\/\\/b23.tv\\/sgm01B3?share_medium=android&amp;share_source=qq&amp;bbid=XY8358281257C10303836FEC93957CA5566EE&amp;ts=1766391572284\"&#44;\"showLittleTail\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePoints\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePointsUrl\":\"\"&#44;\"shareOrigin\":0}}}]"}
{"time": 1766391776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752768082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊什么？！”一下子惊慌起来，瞳孔地震，抓着她的手“怎么不早说？毫无征兆就进入体内了？如果和血根一样的话，会越长越大的……”赶快翻出除病药水，语速很快“如果算寄生虫病的话，应该会奏效吧？先把这个喝了”"}
{"time": 1766391953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477873808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯.......”夜鸦似乎在想怎么该形容自己的行为"}
{"time": 1766392038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673832963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我感觉它很像虚境，很适合我，而且不是很难控制”"}
{"time": 1766392304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528335721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这，可是……”拿着瓶子看着她，忧虑仍然占了上风“还没弄明白是什么存在，而且和你现在的修炼法不知道能不能兼容。我怕会影响你的精神……而且你看，它有点怕治愈魔法，如果任它长下去，以后你受伤了，怎么帮你恢复？”"}
{"time": 1766392398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947768824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“没关系的，实在不好，我们回空间再除掉吧？”"}
{"time": 1766392516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229236960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那总不能再咽回去（））"}
{"time": 1766392538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381730132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（用不着，她吐出来说明早就被寄生了）"}
{"time": 1766392640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120692385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你现在……能感觉到它在身体的哪里吗？能运用吗？”依旧蹙眉，担忧地看着"}
{"time": 1766392772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884252101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "提到这个话题的时候，她稍微低下了头，摸了摸自己的腰“在动，虽然有些疼，但是确实在，还需要些生长在时间”"}
{"time": 1766393031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308863133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "还是感觉异常渗人“噫呃……还是把它弄出来吧？听着就好……吓人”"}
{"time": 1766393399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834188990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那么说来，该不会是昨天夜里……我自己不会也有吧？”仔细感觉一下身体"}
{"time": 1766393416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294521239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在旁边吗)"}
{"time": 1766393433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001154636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知道）"}
{"time": 1766393512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527178534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1308863133]夜鸦还是拒绝了，表示自己不是不那么能接受，以前更难受的时候倒是多的很"}
{"time": 1766393608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227217812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=834188990]看起来是没有的样子"}
{"time": 1766393614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899434405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1294521239]（可以在）"}
{"time": 1766393637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420480633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "查询一下自己和安娜的情况"}
{"time": 1766393679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557410026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "有些无奈，但也不想用强，只能紧紧地握着她的手“什么时候感觉不对劲了，一定要及时说出来”"}
{"time": 1766393799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245607546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1557410026]“嗯，我会好好活下去的”她点了点头“大家也都是那么嘱咐的”"}
{"time": 1766393861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634961963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1420480633]你和安娜似乎都没有，真奇怪，明明你们之中已经有一个人中了招，难道安娜不适合这三种之一吗"}
{"time": 1766393881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978769723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说不定是之二.jpg）"}
