{"time": 1766474844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750628642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“这个被撑开的痕迹不会是那些灵根造成的吧”"}
