{"time": 1766477757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805460737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（这不是玩家吗）"}
{"time": 1766477775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899317717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(主角呗)"}
{"time": 1766477832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925605695", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "并且在真正进入了地下之后你们开始听到地下回想着令人不安的声音，像是某种物体在缓慢撕裂开金属的声音"}
{"time": 1766477841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573476209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "并且在真正进入了地下之后你们开始听到地下回响着令人不安的声音，像是某种物体在缓慢撕裂开金属的声音"}
{"time": 1766477916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137716198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo8Ii5haPTkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQdfpRP07NTwrNt0jqZETItXoCa7KCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMMnFHnNMCiEsVpuouQiaLnHL9QWZrMLYCgPlV8mmea2NA36b3oig41jHEkAyE03-Kw,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1766477961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984093651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森聆听一下，声音哪个方向传来的"}
{"time": 1766477992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143274369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯...在这里还有人，公司的人?\"皱着眉小声"}
{"time": 1766478020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234051819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=749046509]（往哪边）"}
{"time": 1766478074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674405688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“拿着提灯，应该不是那帮用着高科技的”摇摇头“我觉得像骑士团的”"}
{"time": 1766478092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868930213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=984093651]（我觉得应该就是种子单纯还在艹建筑结构）"}
{"time": 1766478103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088760647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那么她也是潜入进来的？”"}
{"time": 1766478135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070537697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "往深处"}
{"time": 1766478176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184494125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也有可能是昨晚就没走，我们跟着她吗？”"}
{"time": 1766478255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679574110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁知道，跟着呗。\""}
{"time": 1766478347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739607103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#跟着看看吧"}
{"time": 1766478491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599283534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么你们一前六后的跟着，一路上虽然你们看不到但是也能听到有爆发打斗的声音，但是在对方继续前进跟上去的时候又没看到尸体"}
{"time": 1766478575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721812238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这家伙把尸体吃了吗?\"有些犯恶心"}
{"time": 1766478655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083512070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "最后，你们跟着进入到了但是培养基地林立着无数人形大小培养罐的地方，你们在外远远的瞥了一眼看到里面漂浮着无数人，他们的身上长着从身体撕裂开来而裸露的棕色赤纹树根，那个人也就在这里放好自己的东西之后坐着休息"}
{"time": 1766478688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593367279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#眼神示意一下，要不要出去？"}
{"time": 1766478708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323747431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#咱们隐身着呢，要不要出去交谈一下？"}
{"time": 1766478756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173273749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(我没意见)"}
{"time": 1766478774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370075471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一个人去就好。\""}
{"time": 1766478823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671765735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那么谁出去呢。。。”#看了一眼猫猫“要不然对我施加变装术吧，我出去看看”"}
{"time": 1766479030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036819497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你今天的能力快用完了吧……狭窄空间，还是我去比较好”"}
{"time": 1766479238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609667265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#对着森华使用变装术"}
{"time": 1766479275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256232795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#变成一个体型较原来略大，容貌相对平凡的妇女"}
{"time": 1766479301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737502217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(-4mp，1mp/min)"}
{"time": 1766479411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809234484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woolLG3zqjTkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQUZ4d-xqRagnHhhikm-y_lXoCHgeCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMArAKzGGwjzSnFxPDjKWmRrOZShr73NXcCURslWXXgY3G2iSrlhQq3V9BWyU8jnzMQ,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1766479427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971507929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "事已至此，拖着长刀从门框后的阴影中离开隐身的范围，脚步声清晰，刀身也直接拖在地上"}
{"time": 1766479547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065411354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么华过去之后，对方立马发现了，虽然略感困惑不过还是提起了刀站起身看向了你“..........什么人”"}
{"time": 1766479753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911030734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "刀斜提在身后，一边不加掩饰地观察对方，一边开口回答“请别担心，不是敌人。”"}
{"time": 1766479914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943272710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你是潜入进来的吧.......请叫我修女”她看着你的状况，似乎并没有什么疑问"}
{"time": 1766480026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947550711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只是对这些……神秘的树根，比较感兴趣。”尽量不看嫣红的地面，左手还拿着手机打光“修女小姐进来的风格倒是好像和我不一样。呆在这里没问题吗？”"}
{"time": 1766480139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105062631", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“既然都是为了赤蜘蛛而来，如果你们有什么事情我不会妨碍的”修女一边说着又坐回了地面"}
{"time": 1766480165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909138138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么就们了（））"}
{"time": 1766480172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905163048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“既然都是为了赤蜘蛛而来，如果你有什么事情我不会妨碍的”修女一边说着又坐回了地面"}
{"time": 1766480172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562411248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（怎么就们了（））"}
{"time": 1766480189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295244757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(赤蜘蛛是啥)"}
