{"time": 1766480370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911492855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（你问靠谱点，万一搜了有人定位到我们这边呢）"}
{"time": 1766480385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410591184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "赛博世界，没有黑客学识别乱搜[CQ:face,id=277,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;]"}
{"time": 1766480436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379259157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……意思是，我取走一具也没关系吗？”站到一台培养罐旁边"}
{"time": 1766480527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954997608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，不过要我说可能留在这里更好哦”"}
{"time": 1766480626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065182829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“因为有人在来的路上？”仔细看看培养罐内的情况，用反光戒备着修女本人"}
{"time": 1766480648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910722250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“来的路上的那些人，都被你解决了吧”"}
{"time": 1766480729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93318570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，当然”"}
{"time": 1766480783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930761419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "她简单的说着，不知道是回哪句"}
{"time": 1766480862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400459818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你倒是很放心，我们应该不能完全算一伙人吧。”还是挥刀，在玻璃上切出口子来"}
{"time": 1766480989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150351878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "培养罐被劈开口子后盛装着的液体逐渐开始溢出，里面悬浮着的人也就开始逐渐变下沉去"}
{"time": 1766481162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "124569006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果你不非要袭击我的话，就不会有问题”"}
{"time": 1766481372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061835007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你看起来不像骑士团的人。也对，都叫修女了。”虽然感觉有点渗人，但是不得不伸手把样本抓出来"}
{"time": 1766481578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425484845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么你又劈开了一下，抱住了掉出来的人，你注意到从培养液出来之后对方身上的树根开始蠕动了，那落出来的人正因痛苦而呻吟"}
{"time": 1766481645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304299736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“骑士团，只是我的师傅在里面而已”修女边说着，视线放在了你的身上，或者该说是你怀里的人身上"}
{"time": 1766481817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056633578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以你没有血根？”用治愈魔法给拖出来的这个人续下命"}
{"time": 1766481823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267936354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们的魔力感知呢）"}
{"time": 1766481833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961715855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(+0)"}
{"time": 1766481926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385808142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(藏在暗处)"}
{"time": 1766481967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391299451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“有，无论是光，暗，还是血”对方没什么避讳的直接开口说道，又将视线垂下去了"}
{"time": 1766481985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1798757286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2056633578]你治了大概三下，至少对方没有当场暴毙，树根也安稳下来了"}
{"time": 1766482058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56521367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真巧，一天能见到两个这样的人”开始往门口移动“一会要是真有人来了，你打算怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1766482118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387650294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(怎么办?只有，杀)"}
{"time": 1766482148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378669208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是敌人就杀了”"}
{"time": 1766482205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331770273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(我觉得我们可以不用藏了)"}
{"time": 1766482210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950101118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(我的魔力并不多)"}
{"time": 1766482237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703948059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(维持你的变装术还要维持群影)"}
{"time": 1766482239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1190064063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从暗处走出，事已至此，感知一下魔力"}
