{"time": 1766485964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259634021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=824544186]“我说的不是你那个……是别的爆炸”"}
{"time": 1766485981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845321475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“？”她露出了些许疑惑的神情"}
{"time": 1766486097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811230568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛。\"深呼吸，\"半径一公里左右的大爆炸哦?\"随后笑嘻嘻地看着她，\"现在你不跟着我们出去的话...我可不管你的死活呢～\""}
{"time": 1766486147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006709115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不了，地下还要到更深的地方”"}
{"time": 1766486299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809313587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"她是不是有点看不起我?\"看着四周的队友，\"我在这里用，可以吗？\""}
{"time": 1766486482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905269864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（给队友三轮的逃跑时间吗，有意思）"}
{"time": 1766486498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593500831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不可以，你自己也会没命的”叉着腰，身体前倾“还不知道那东西在哪里呢”"}
{"time": 1766486606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964290228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "微微皱眉，\"那就离远点，这种机会很难得的。\"说完立刻起身拉着安娜往外走"}
{"time": 1766486689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996072444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "—————————"}
