{"time": 1766648887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085309280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们站在范围之外，看着一条绵延的大道所顺延的千里之外，层层叠叠的红色圆环浮现于地表，最终伴随着砰的巨响，热浪流过你们的周边，等待着火光散开"}
{"time": 1766648901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738768768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（正常，我也干了）"}
{"time": 1766648920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097644003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（区区范围大过射程，虽然我可以在我的攻击里回状态）"}
{"time": 1766648925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78580098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明天就又该上新闻了……”喃喃"}
{"time": 1766649003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590245459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呼呼...\"心满意足，虽然魔力被抽空，但有衣服的支撑倒也能维持行动，不过安娜在旁边的话...顺势倒在她身上，\"走吧安娜，我已经满足了。\""}
{"time": 1766649020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986135618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们看见地面百米之深的地方已然融化作了琉璃，大概是因为强力的挤压导致，无数的通道被裸露于表面，你们甚至能看见已然溶解的某些根枝正在延伸还原"}
{"time": 1766649078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993119694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "随后毫不意外的你们听到了无人机的声音开始从外围向内飞来"}
{"time": 1766649082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096795637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo4Ifa16DYkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQyg_4Dtleby6F3OLBVn9KWXoCbZuCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMIPpYEz-h4xYvkU8vOfhf8yrHV_pTQIneKuVdWxCqlttzvz_50W28dgOOhd13Fa0eA,file_size=39951]"}
