{"time": 1766649153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955878887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森依旧安静术搭配猫猫的隐身出去吧，魔力不够就喝药水"}
{"time": 1766649169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970052618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=760877328]（所以）"}
{"time": 1766649177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863957348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这人走了吗）"}
{"time": 1766649192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670501359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（没啊）"}
{"time": 1766649226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394696539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你觉得刚炸了个百米好像还真差不多快到她那里了"}
{"time": 1766649320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53975790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好像没能彻底铲除啊……”看着正在恢复的根系，皱了皱眉，在剑尖上展开折射立场，过去掩护安娜一起撤退"}
{"time": 1766649377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747654546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "我倒"}
{"time": 1766649426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300628952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“这个生命力真顽强呀”"}
{"time": 1766649485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021828661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们一行准备的准备，施法的施法，深入全程也大约不过五小时左右，其中没法自由回蓝的逃跑也就占用半小时（自己从满状态开始扣这个30分钟内施法的mp）"}
{"time": 1766649524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421227135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "顺利的是，无人机哪怕乌泱泱的飞着，在隐形的加持下你们也没被发现地回到了电网前"}
{"time": 1766649541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594375651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo7urOsqLYkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQiUpZV_NAfjPS3HjwO5uOy3oC8_iCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMIPpYEz-h4xYvkU8vOfhf8yrHV_pTQIneKuVdWxCqlttzvz_50W28dgOOhd13Fa0eA,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1766649559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721366316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(1mp啊我)"}
{"time": 1766649562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467541009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（仙仙0 mp了直接？一顿饭回十多点蓝几乎废了）"}
{"time": 1766649566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99717249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还有什么好说)"}
{"time": 1766649694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267886829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（我带了6拼mp药水）"}
{"time": 1766649707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742701690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（瘫，我觉得你是来帮我清库存的）"}
{"time": 1766649711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437467399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道修女和那些培养罐是什么情况，不过那些……全都是血根吗？占据了好多地方……”发现没人靠近就收起屏障来“不过好像得步行一段了，这边应该不会有出租车靠近了吧？”"}
{"time": 1766649744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910124995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“出租车记录可能会查到我们，不如脚走吧，正好吃个晚餐”"}
{"time": 1766649935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994500592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woohLyl7qPYkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ6WyIxDZXOrWkgAJKRbAQcXoC8teCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMIPpYEz-h4xYvkU8vOfhf8yrHV_pTQIneKuVdWxCqlttzvz_50W28dgOOhd13Fa0eA,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1766649940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642445360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（那么？）"}
{"time": 1766649954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578575559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过要不要等一下那个修女？”"}
{"time": 1766649968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801547324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "尽管有衣服的加持，但是依然不想动弹，软绵绵地靠着安娜。"}
{"time": 1766649999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "134989158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果修女还活着，之后恐怕免不了敌对……吧？”无奈摇头“总感觉她的态度很奇怪，对我们、对公司都很……不关心，对这些实验体也是”"}
{"time": 1766650005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723578523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "安娜公主抱着仙仙，看着里面的状况，大概还是有点担心的"}
{"time": 1766650187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584364541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了?\"跟着视线，\"我的功夫还是不到家啊...\"感叹"}
{"time": 1766650226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531199022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“唉”"}
{"time": 1766650319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "494929078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“没什么”安娜虽然有些忧心忡忡的样子，不过还是摇了摇头，露出来了个微笑“仙仙姐已经很努力了”"}
{"time": 1766650404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002484911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……明天记得关注一下新闻吧。”抬头看看天幕"}
{"time": 1766650546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179638507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=494929078]\"安娜是不是有事瞒着我?\"皱了皱眉，伸手有气无力地捏了捏她的手臂"}
{"time": 1766650660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013179595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“没有的，我支持大家的决定”"}
{"time": 1766650701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822836912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么你们边聊着边走，夜晚的街道依旧灯火通明，看着也有不少餐厅可以选择"}
{"time": 1766650718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768151596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看看月亮有没有什么变化"}
{"time": 1766650759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606930519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "月亮还是那样，在你们眼里像是被树木的棕色根系包裹着"}
{"time": 1766650816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229122835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "不过现在雾霾又越来越浓了，看起来很快晚上也要看不着月亮"}
{"time": 1766650876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4153470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“雾霾，这里面的环境也这么差吗”"}
{"time": 1766650912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680826037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（月亮在外边呢，当然吃雾霾）"}
{"time": 1766650913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997949939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我上不了街啊.jpg）"}
{"time": 1766650922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172169821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（怎么了，为什么）"}
{"time": 1766650927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163019461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"用只有安娜听得见地声音小声开口，\"嚯，安娜没回答我的问题——快点告诉我啦。\""}
{"time": 1766650928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1714145033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（手上还扛着个实验体）"}
{"time": 1766650974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "592733219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“那我们想办法回去吧，然后我再出来买些吃食”"}
{"time": 1766651051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998354037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……或者回书店？这种情况我们完全不了解”看着说不定占比已经比血肉多的根系，总感觉不忍直视"}
{"time": 1766651117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523201226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“都行，反正这个实验题我扛不动，我跟着你们就好”"}
{"time": 1766651181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443850830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woozqe3wKjYkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQYvT8V2wywJhiLaY2Sd3z_3oCAu2CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMIPpYEz-h4xYvkU8vOfhf8yrHV_pTQIneKuVdWxCqlttzvz_50W28dgOOhd13Fa0eA,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1766651215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252018517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（好冷）"}
