{"time": 1767448554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126502648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“包子或者别的吧”"}
{"time": 1767448568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103830525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woom4e_gMPvkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQt5u_jouN2rlNxD9HBNnEY3oCs5KCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMLG4wjzrv5mN4J_JZ0creAzrsJ3nPsgpaQwDkzE7-Btu_wmwjr90KGkg66CRHe1pWA,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1767448579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688263300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉吃了不少，魔力也没回复多少。\"揉揉肚子，\"好胀。\""}
{"time": 1767448634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457420615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“毕竟这里的人主要还是吃营养膏。”"}
{"time": 1767448666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989403662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#拿出一瓶魔力药水给仙仙“喝下去可以恢复100mp，不过我也没有几瓶，先应急吧”"}
{"time": 1767448668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571318436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1483468959]“开刀可能场面会有点恶心，你没有意见的话”"}
{"time": 1767448763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143976528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……为了预防我的伙伴也被血根影响而我无从下手的情况发生”手攥在胸前“我得看看”"}
{"time": 1767448773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997290224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我就先收着咯?\"笑着接过，\"帕特森真是体贴。\"不过不打算现在就喝，\"短时间应该用不上吧。\""}
{"time": 1767448832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032563282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这可不是能治疗的手术.......不过要看的话，随便吧”"}
{"time": 1767448964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "158445551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1997290224]“emmm，这几天要是没有事就吃些东西回复魔力吧，是真没想到这个世界的魔力恢复如此艰难”"}
{"time": 1767448981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835893102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我这边还有七八瓶，应该足够吧”"}
{"time": 1767448992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703101474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“省着点。”"}
{"time": 1767449016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564855416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当然，之后我会收敛点...应该吧。\""}
{"time": 1767449032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1278812995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“嗯呐”#摸摸头"}
