{"time": 1767449641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060085160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不用，她的意识暂时是没法回复的”亚麻又划开了许多，细微，如同发霉菌的血跟长满了心脏，被手术刀轻微的刮后表现出了明显的活性，如同互动般，或者该说绒毛般的摇晃了"}
{"time": 1767449715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696941091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "在这个时候，直接看去就能明显的看到整个身体左上侧为起点，不同在表面有着小指大小，整整1/3的部位都爬满了如绒毛般的血根"}
{"time": 1767449749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401542128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是恶兆之子）"}
{"time": 1767449768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77879582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(疑似阿凡达)"}
{"time": 1767449769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819612396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（头上有没有角）"}
{"time": 1767449813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435777461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“没能彻底融合，又没有因为排异反应当场死亡就会这样”"}
{"time": 1767449822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838238137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“即便程度并不深”"}
{"time": 1767449847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037950518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这些……全都要刮掉吗？”靠近了些，在一片血呼呼中分辨着"}
{"time": 1767449921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551835949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“刮掉也没用，我要剖开心脏了，先前其实没有说完实话，你看”她用手术刀轻轻的捋过伤口的边缘，刮下来了绒毛般的血根（过个难度18的侦查）"}
{"time": 1767449973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801025881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+2"}
