{"time": 1767450047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1884958832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（额😑亚麻会讲解吗）"}
{"time": 1767450072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138935465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（首先要说自己不知道）"}
{"time": 1767450085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597603732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这些要收集起来吗？”"}
{"time": 1767450117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450355649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不是看这个......”"}
{"time": 1767450134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36273486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又长出来了是吧）"}
{"time": 1767450190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253117208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“即便是这种程度的绒毛也已经开始再生试图将伤口愈合了，在刺激下这些血根的反应会更加剧烈”"}
{"time": 1767450220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364314233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我接下来要抛开心脏，取出里面的血种，再辅助残局的再生能力让她恢复”"}
{"time": 1767450258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161066433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“像是……菌丝。没了核心，其余部分还会发挥作用？”有些意外"}
{"time": 1767450278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364962380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果她不能靠这个挺回来，那就只能靠补救计划了”"}
{"time": 1767450305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614656982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“即便失去核心，养分与能量没有耗尽，它们就不会死亡”"}
{"time": 1767450528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305839039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "不过亚麻没有立刻动手剖开心脏，而是确认了状况之后拿出了枚背面烙的通红的芯片按在心脏上，随后动手开始将剖开的伤口缝合"}
{"time": 1767450557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854423270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“接下来要花些时间监视，取血，之后可以用来反复打回她自己的身体”"}
{"time": 1767450604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803348349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“刚刚那枚芯片……是什么？”想了想“或许我可以加速一下这个流程”"}
{"time": 1767450619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972335447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“体质好也是方便我们动手术，什么？”"}
{"time": 1767450652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566479288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只要恢复的快些，就可以很快开展下一步了吧？”"}
{"time": 1767450752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129907604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯.........不能完全这么说，你也看到刚刚那个芯片了，那是个可以尽量降低血根活性的东西”"}
{"time": 1767450772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012509928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么是这么降低的（）"}
{"time": 1767450778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516691089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“直接的来说，我担心剖开心脏的时候被缠在里面”"}
{"time": 1767450803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453413279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（谁知道呢）"}
{"time": 1767450971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48568614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我倒是有把大点的刀，单靠剑术，有办法避免吗？”"}
{"time": 1767451074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230883435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“？”对方有些无语的撇了你“或许有可能吧，不过失败的话就是她的命了”"}
{"time": 1767451141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511586874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……好吧，那还是先静观其变好了……现在该做什么？”"}
{"time": 1767451233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278243971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“休息吧，看见这些东西就费我的心力”"}
{"time": 1767451243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492431268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "亚麻格外嫌弃的说了句"}
{"time": 1767451408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459532006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“抱歉……不过亚麻小姐知道这么多，但还是这么做了。”顿了顿“是出于同病相怜吗？”"}
{"time": 1767451541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956904663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“只是一时兴起罢了”亚麻别过了头去“我现在对这种低效的利用方法也不感兴趣”"}
{"time": 1767451654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882475236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……用人命堆出来的东西，终究让人……接受不了”低头敲了敲自己的胸口“如果有得选，亚麻小姐，会选择当一个普通人吗？”"}
{"time": 1767451782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923618137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“成为会随时间的流逝最终死亡的凡人吗，即便不是渐冻症，我也不会想要”亚麻拿着一大块布给实验体打包了起来，塞进了个角落"}
{"time": 1767451962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83489810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……我们这次听到了血蜘蛛这一称谓”等她忙完，试探性开口“其他的两根，应该也有类似的……来源？”"}
{"time": 1767452037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075409395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你是说，赤蜘蛛？”"}
{"time": 1767452044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476527341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1767452049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770503482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“对”"}
{"time": 1767452052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880075274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（还有什么修女）"}
{"time": 1767452076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734377057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你听了月之三女神的说法？”"}
{"time": 1767452124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160464738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，一个自称是某个骑士团成员的徒弟的人说的”"}
{"time": 1767452175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420735023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“事先说好我可不认同。我认为血，光，暗三种元素的力量其实源自于超古代的魔族”"}
{"time": 1767452237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032218463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“古代的魔族有各种各样，而其中掌握着血，光，喑力量的三个魔族达成了与人类的某种合作，因此人类才会拥有这三种力量”"}
{"time": 1767452301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468385707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“但魔族究竟发生了什么，那三位与人类合作的又后来如何了，这些难以考察。而是否与月亮的异常有关，我不认为是能简单下定论的”"}
{"time": 1767452304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185210851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（听起来就很像野史（）"}
{"time": 1767452331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684119164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（请选择性相信.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767452401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794252815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔族？”听起来总感觉和这个世界有些格格不入“我还没听过别人提过这些……亚麻小姐有相关的藏书吗？”"}
{"time": 1767452457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889567557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不，这是我个人实验拼凑出来的结果，以及结合了公开的可阅读历史”"}
{"time": 1767452540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153917278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "随后亚麻忽然叹了一口气“我就直接说了，留下她，我也是有做实验的打算”"}
{"time": 1767452633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000489847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“和公司的方向应该不一样吧？”"}
{"time": 1767452817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252142632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我打算，尝试让她向着魔族的方向返祖，这样或许也能更好的适应血根”"}
{"time": 1767452880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042809795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“本来我打算自己做的”她停顿了下接着说"}
{"time": 1767452898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501837120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“无论是否有实际意义，这会涉及到，她是否还是自己的伦理问题”"}
{"time": 1767452927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026411396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“一个不论灵魂还是肉体，都被转化的人........究竟还是自己吗？”她一边说着直视着你"}
{"time": 1767453023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181086803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我想……恐怕不完全是。不过我想没有人能始终如一吧”想了想，摇摇头“她得先醒过来才有选择权”"}
{"time": 1767453101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866362141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“恐怕她撑不到那个时候”"}
{"time": 1767453122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573141614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“或者该说，这是不可能的”"}
{"time": 1767453169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813512485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……我不会反对你的实验的，就当给大家一个机会”顿了顿“如果她出现了认知问题，我也有办法”"}
{"time": 1767453287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011276616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "亚麻点了点头，没说什么了"}
{"time": 1767453316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344199096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了，亚麻小姐想吃什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1767453390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388340010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我已经点外卖了，很快披萨就会送到”"}
{"time": 1767453429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31634904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（[CQ:face,id=338,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;]）"}
{"time": 1767453467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369362801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧，我也该和同伴汇合了。如果亚麻小姐想分享什么……随时可以联系”躬身行礼，准备离开了"}
{"time": 1767453489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859246457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（感觉收获不少）"}
{"time": 1767453558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1427919409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "亚麻没有什么行动，你顺利的离开了"}
{"time": 1767453565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379558252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "—————————"}
